- (B): \( \boxed{\text{CH}_3\text{CH}=\text{C}(\text{CH}_3)_2} \) (2-Methylbut-2-ene)  
- (C): \( \boxed{\text{CH}_3\text{COCH}_3} \) (Acetone)  
- (D): \( \boxed{\text{CH}_3\text{CH}_2\text{CHO}} \) (Propanal)
