","Let $a_1 = (-2015, 14)$.
We are given that $a_n - a_{n-1} = (1, 1)$ for all $n >1$.
Thus, $a_n = a_{n-1} + (1, 1)$.
We can find the general formula for $n$ in terms of $n-1$.
